      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel this would not fix all the race conditions. Another cpu would be able to still pass the is_pkvm_initialized() check, if this current cpu is just about to set it. I am thinking if we should protect these hypercalls with a lock which will act as a memory barrier as well. What do you think?",
